cmp5v3xz20048nw0ktz8xj67u', 'cmp5v3xz20041nw0krqr3c7i5', '7. How did you collaborate with Product or Analytics teams on data requirements?', 6, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5v8k6q004hnw0k3wcpvw6u', 'cmp5nvkbw0003nw0kw0uxkvum', '1. How many Agile teams have you managed simultaneously?', 0, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5v8k6q004inw0kgmu4748f', 'cmp5nvkbw0003nw0kw0uxkvum', '2. What Agile transformation initiative did you lead recently?', 1, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5v8k6q004jnw0kmeqr3u98', 'cmp5nvkbw0003nw0kw0uxkvum', '3. How did you handle repeated sprint spillovers or missed commitments?', 2, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5v8k6q004knw0ksnhfwu3b', 'cmp5nvkbw0003nw0kw0uxkvum', '4. What Jira or ADO dashboards did you create for leadership tracking?', 3, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5v8k6q004lnw0kxu4b0vfn', 'cmp5nvkbw0003nw0kw0uxkvum', '5. How did you resolve conflicts between engineering and business teams?', 4, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5v8k6q004mnw0kd33a5wtt', 'cmp5nvkbw0003nw0kw0uxkvum', '6. What impediment did you remove that improved delivery speed?', 5, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5v8k6q004nnw0kxvnasb7y', 'cmp5nvkbw0003nw0kw0uxkvum', '7. How have you handled dependencies across multiple Scrum teams?', 6, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5v8k6q004onw0k7tz6ugr6', 'cmp5nvkbw0003nw0kw0uxkvum', '8. Have you worked as a Lead? What was the team size?', 7, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5vc9ti004rnw0km70iadj3', 'cmp5vc9ti004qnw0kw0tw99bb', '1. What agentic AI workflow have you built in production?', 0, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5vc9ti004snw0k6tf1nmaj', 'cmp5vc9ti004qnw0kw0tw99bb', '2. How did you integrate LLM APIs into existing data pipelines?', 1, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5vc9ti004tnw0ks2u6z75k', 'cmp5vc9ti004qnw0kw0tw99bb', '3. What real-world problem did you solve using LangChain or CrewAI?', 2, true, null, null, 'medium'), ('cmp5vc9ti004unw0kmed91u1m', 'cmp5vc9ti004qnw0kw0tw99bb', '4. How did you optimize